e, actual outcomes, destination contents, or whether the links were used or visited."}], "visual": [{"element_id": "V001", "observation": "A Binance-branded screen visibly promotes a referral program with the text “It pays to have friends!”, while the tutorial instructs the viewer to click the registration button.", "dimensions": ["reward_or_return_claim", "requested_action"], "frame_ids": ["F0007"], "context": "The content appears in a tutorial demonstrating Binance registration and features; the referral message is presented as promotional on-screen text.", "potential_relevance": "A promised payment is visibly linked to recruiting or referring friends and to an account-registration action, which conditionally merits review of the referral terms and destination.", "limitations": "These sampled frames do not establish the referral amount, eligibility conditions, payout process, authenticity of the destination, or whether any payment occurs."}], "textual_context_notes": [], "visual_context_notes": [{"observation": "The sampled video is framed as a tutorial about using Binance, showing registration, account pages, deposits, and trading interfaces.", "frame_ids": ["F0001", "F0012", "F0024", "F0035", "F0047"]}]}, "annotation": {"binary_label": "Scam", "primary_subtype": "S04", "content_role": "promotion_or_instruction", "contextual_rationale": "This video is scam content because it promotes passive Bitcoin-mining income and directs viewers to an external BitClub link while also soliciting Binance registration through a referral URL. The frames show step-by-step account registration, deposits, trading, and a final instruction to start Binance registration, indicating promotion rather than reporting or criticism. The material does not establish the external service's actual operations or outcomes, but the combination of an easy-income claim, consequential links, and registration solicitation supports the scam classification.", "fine_grained_rationale": "The description explicitly links passive money earning to Bitcoin mining. This grounds the mining-return mechanism, although the supplied evidence does not specify a purchased hashpower package, mining equipment share, node, membership, or recurring payout terms.", "evidence": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "observation": "The description states that viewers can earn passive money through Bitcoin mining.", "source_id": "DESCRIPTION_0001", "quote": "verdiene passiv Geld im Bitcoin Mining"}, {"evidence_id": "E002", "observation": "The description instructs viewers to buy altcoins and Bitcoin and provides a Binance referral URL.", "source_id": "DESCRIPTION_0001", "quote": "Kaufe Altcoins und Bitcoin und Co: https://www.binance.com/?ref=12567770"}, {"evidence_id": "E003", "observation": "The supplied frame visibly shows a Binance interface with a registration-directed arrow and a banner reading “Binance Referral Program” and “It pays to have friends!”", "source_id": "F0006", "quote": ""}, {"evidence_id": "E004", "observation": "The supplied frame visibly shows a Binance account page with an on-screen instruction to click Funds and deposit cryptocurrency.", "source_id": "F0028", "quote": ""}, {"evidence_id": "E005", "observation": "The supplied frame visibly shows a cryptocurrency trading interface with buy and sell controls and a market chart.", "source_id": "F0048", "quote": ""}, {"evidence_id": "E006", "observation": "The supplied frame displays the instruction “Please read description for information!” and “Click here and Start your Binance Registration!”", "source_id": "F0059", "quote": ""}]}}
